{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14423","headline":"相思曲 · 戴叔伦","name":"相思曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高楼重重闭明月，肠断僊郎隔年别。\n紫箫横笛寂无声，独向瑶窗坐愁绝。\n鱼沈鴈杳天涯路，始信人间别离苦。\n恨满牙牀翡翠衾，怨折金钗凤皇股。\n井深辘轳嗟绠短，衣带相思日应缓。\n将刀斫水水复连，挥刃割情情不断。\n落红乱逐东流水，一点芳心爲君死。\n妾身愿作巫山云，飞入仙郎梦魂里。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"戴叔伦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14423.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14423","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}